## 🔧 **Complete Setup Command**

```powershell
# Run this entire script to set up HR messaging structure

Write-Host "🏗️ Setting up HR Messaging Structure..." -ForegroundColor Magenta

# Create HR pages
cd client/src/pages/common
New-Item -ItemType File -Force -Path "ContactHR.jsx" -Value "// Contact HR Page" | Out-Null
New-Item -ItemType File -Force -Path "HRChatPage.jsx" -Value "// HR Chat Interface" | Out-Null

cd ../hr
New-Item -ItemType File -Force -Path "HRMessageInbox.jsx" -Value "// HR Message Inbox" | Out-Null
New-Item -ItemType File -Force -Path "HRTicketSystem.jsx" -Value "// HR Support Tickets" | Out-Null

# Create HR messaging components
cd ../../components
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path "hr-messaging" | Out-Null
cd hr-messaging

@(
    "HRChatWindow.jsx",
    "HRMessageList.jsx", 
    "HRMessageItem.jsx",
    "HRChatSidebar.jsx",
    "ContactHRButton.jsx",
    "HRNotificationBadge.jsx",
    "MessageInput.jsx",
    "HRTypingIndicator.jsx"
) | ForEach-Object {
    New-Item -ItemType File -Force -Path $_ -Value "// $(Split-Path $_ -Leaf)" | Out-Null
}

# Create database schemas
cd ../../../../database/firestore/collections

@(
    "hrMessages.schema.js",
    "hrConversations.schema.js",
    "hrTickets.schema.js"
) | ForEach-Object {
    New-Item -ItemType File -Force -Path $_ -Value "// HR $(Split-Path $_ -Leaf)" | Out-Null
}

Write-Host "`n✅ HR Messaging Structure Complete!" -ForegroundColor Green
Write-Host "📁 Added:" -ForegroundColor Cyan
Write-Host "   - 2 HR pages (ContactHR.jsx, HRChatPage.jsx)" -ForegroundColor Yellow
Write-Host "   - 2 HR inbox pages (HRMessageInbox.jsx, HRTicketSystem.jsx)" -ForegroundColor Yellow
Write-Host "   - 8 HR messaging components" -ForegroundColor Yellow
Write-Host "   - 3 Database schemas" -ForegroundColor Yellow
```

## 💬 **Features of HR Messaging System**

### **For Interns:**
- **Contact HR Button** - Floating button throughout the app
- **Direct Messaging** - Chat with HR team
- **Support Tickets** - Raise issues/concerns
- **Message History** - View all conversations
- **Attachments** - Upload screenshots/files
- **Read Receipts** - Know when HR saw your message

### **For HR:**
- **Message Inbox** - All intern messages in one place
- **Ticket System** - Categorize and track issues
- **Quick Responses** - Pre-written templates
- **Message Status** - Open/In Progress/Resolved
- **Priority Levels** - Urgent/Normal/Low
- **Bulk Actions** - Respond to multiple messages

### **For Admins:**
- **Monitor HR Response Time** - Track performance
- **View All Conversations** - Quality control
- **Escalation System** - Forward to admin if needed
- **Analytics Dashboard** - Message volume, response rates

